OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain but
OL,7,Fbrighter conditions edge south through
OL,8,Fthe morning to leave the afternoon
OL,9,Flargely dry with sunny spells. Cloud
OL,10,Fincreasing again across Galloway
OL,11,Ftowards sunset. Mainly light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRather cloudy across the
OL,14,Fsouth this evening with a few spots of
OL,15,Frain, otherwise dry with long clear
OL,16,Fspells developing. With light winds, a
OL,17,Ftouch of ground frost is possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
