OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly, dry start with
OL,6,Fsunny spells but showers reach
OL,7,FDumfries and Galloway through the
OL,8,Fmorning and Lothian and Borders in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds turning more
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly and freshening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FBright, chilly start Thursday but
OL,14,Fincreasing cloud brings occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy afternoon rain. The rain clears
OL,16,Fovernight to leave Friday and Saturday
OL,17,Fwith sunny spells and increasingly
OL,18,Ffrequent heavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
